<title>BELGIUM: EU to set remote island 97/98 cereal, rice needs.</title>
<headline>EU to set remote island 97/98 cereal, rice needs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee is due on Thursday to decide how much subsidised cereals and rice should be sent to the Canary Islands, Madeira and the Azores in 1997/98 (July/June), EU officials said.</p>
<p>Cereals and rice shipments to these remote Spanish and Portuguese islands benefit from EU export refunds.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
